{"case_id": "spatial_join-005", "operation": "spatial_join", "split": "test", "prompt": "For every point, join the attributes of the nearest station within 2000 m, measured in UTM zone 33N (EPSG:32633), and add the distance in meters as distance_m. Keep points with no station that close, with null station attributes and distance (left join). Keep the point geometries in the points layer's CRS.", "inputs": {"files": {"left": "fixtures/join_points.geojson", "right": "fixtures/join_stations.geojson"}, "params": {"predicate": "nearest", "how": "left", "max_distance": 2000, "units": "m", "crs": "EPSG:32633"}}, "expected": "expected/spatial_join-005.json", "tolerances": {"tol_m": {"value": 0.001, "units": "m"}, "float_tol": {"value": 0.01, "units": "m"}}, "metric_params": {"key": "point_id"}, "strata": {"operation": "spatial_join", "join": "nearest_max_distance", "predicate": "nearest", "trap": false}}
{"case_id": "spatial_join-006", "operation": "spatial_join", "split": "test", "prompt": "Join the zone attributes to every point of the UTM points layer that lies within a zone (inner join, predicate within). The two layers are in different CRSs. Answer in the points layer's CRS.", "inputs": {"files": {"left": "fixtures/join_points_utm.geojson", "right": "fixtures/join_zones.geojson"}, "params": {"predicate": "within", "how": "inner"}}, "expected": "expected/spatial_join-006.json", "tolerances": {"tol_m": {"value": 0.001, "units": "m"}}, "metric_params": {"key": "point_id"}, "strata": {"operation": "spatial_join", "join": "crs_mismatch", "predicate": "within", "trap": true}}
